# The layer stack at 640x400 CSS px at 1x: under a 44 px bar, a scroll
# region of cards, each a title row (y 53..87 for the first) holding the
# layer's kind, over the readout snippet rendered for that layer (y
# 87..135): a thumbnail at x 21..69, a line of text, and a button.
pixel 300 60 #171b1f          the first card's title row
pixel 300 125 #ffffff         the first card's body, under its children
pixel 26 100 #5b9bd5          the thumbnail's top-left quadrant: sky
pixel 64 122 #70ad47          its bottom-right quadrant
pixel 578 104 #3a7bd5         the Edit button
pixel 300 140 #e9ecef         between the first and second cards
ink 80 100 200 120 #ffffff    the readout text is drawn
ink 18 62 80 80 #171b1f       the first card's title, its layer's kind, is drawn

# A phone: the same cards, narrower.
at 390x800
pixel 200 60 #171b1f          the first card's title row
pixel 26 100 #5b9bd5          the thumbnail
